# gitconfig-local
# define git configurations here that are machine specific and not stored in version control
#
# credential helpers are per-OS (the shared gitconfigs do not set one on linux):
#   mac:   active in utils/gitconfig (osxkeychain) — nothing needed here
#   linux: uncomment below if HTTPS remotes need credentials; composes with
#          direnv (.envrc exports GH_TOKEN, helper runs in the repo cwd)
#
# ## linux credential helper (gh-backed; see git-host-auth skill)
# [credential]
#   helper = !gh auth git-credential

